cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "puuwaawaa-sdm: structured decision making optimizer for Puʻuwaʻawaʻa Forest Reserve"
abstract: >-
  Integer-programming optimizer, figure and table scripts, and sensitivity
  and fire-feedback analyses for a structured decision making study of 11
  management alternatives across 22 paddocks at Puʻuwaʻawaʻa Forest Reserve,
  Hawaiʻi, under seven weighting scenarios and five budget levels.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/olesonlab/puuwaawaa-sdm"
